Fonts (bundled in the package, tracegauge/web/static/fonts/)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

All five font files are licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. The licence text
and copyright line for each family ship next to the fonts:

  tracegauge/web/static/fonts/OFL-IBM-Plex.txt
  tracegauge/web/static/fonts/OFL-Space-Grotesk.txt

