  Derived from IBM Plex Sans. Copyright 2019 IBM Corp. All rights reserved.
  Upstream: https://github.com/IBM/plex
TG Mono (tgmono-400.woff2, tgmono-600.woff2)
  Derived from IBM Plex Mono. Copyright 2017 IBM Corp. All rights reserved.
  Upstream: https://github.com/IBM/plex
Space Grotesk (spacegrotesk-700.woff2)
  Copyright 2020 The Space Grotesk Project Authors
  (https://github.com/floriankarsten/space-grotesk)

Modification statement (OFL-1.1 definition of "Modified Version", and clauses 2, 3 and 5). All
five files are Modified Versions of the upstream fonts: glyphs were deleted (IBM Plex Mono
Regular: 1207 upstream glyphs, 84 shipped) and the files are WOFF2 conversions. IBM Plex carries
the Reserved Font Name "Plex", and clause 3 forbids a Modified Version from using it, so the four
IBM Plex files were renamed in every name record (including the variable font's named
instances, now "TGSans-*") and in the dashboard CSS to "TG Sans" and "TG Mono", with the glyph
outlines unchanged; "Plex" no longer appears in any name record or in the file names. The
copyright lines still credit IBM Corp., as the licence requires.
Space Grotesk declares no Reserved Font Name and keeps its name. The modified
fonts remain under OFL-1.1 (clause 5) and are not sold by themselves (clause 1).

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data in the source repository (not in the PyPI package)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The repository (not the wheel or sdist) contains third-party trajectory data that is not covered
by the licence on tracegauge's own code. Dataset names, URLs, licences and what was changed are in
DATA_SOURCES.md:

  zai-org/CC-Bench-trajectories                (MIT)

Numbers computed from two further datasets, with no trajectory text kept, are also in the
repository. They are attributed in DATA_SOURCES.md, which also states the change made (the
trajectories were reduced to counts and labels):

  nebius/SWE-agent-trajectories                (CC-BY-4.0)
  nebius/SWE-rebench-openhands-trajectories    (CC-BY-4.0)

The repository also holds public instance ids and patch statistics that refer to
SWE-Gym/OpenHands-Sampled-Trajectories (no licence stated on its dataset card). No trajectory
text from it is kept; see DATA_SOURCES.md.

Aggregate statistics computed from SALT-NLP/SWE-chat (ODC-BY 1.0) are quoted in the README; the
data itself is not distributed. See DATA_SOURCES.md for the required notice.
